mod-audio-stream (1.0.0-4) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add synchronized per-session stream lifecycle state management.
  * Prevent concurrent start and cleanup race conditions.
  * Improve media bug failure and channel hangup cleanup.
  * Ensure initial metadata precedes streamed audio frames.
  * Fix initial metadata argument validation.
  * Update libwsc with WebSocket protocol, security and lifecycle hardening.

